    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Ella Dunphy are delighted to present this superb two-bedroom apartment to the market, ideally situated in the heart of Kilkenny City Centre. Offering bright, well-proportioned accommodation and an unbeatable location, this property presents an exceptional opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a low-maintenance home within walking distance of every conceivable amenity.\n\nThe apartment has been thoughtfully designed to maximise both space and natural light, with a practical layout that offers comfortable modern living. Generously proportioned accommodation creates a warm and welcoming atmosphere, while the convenience of apartment living makes this an ideal choice for busy professionals, downsizers and commuters alike.\n\nLocation is undoubtedly one of the property's standout features. Residents enjoy direct access to MacDonagh Junction Shopping Centre, home to an excellent selection of retail stores, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and entertainment facilities. Kilkenny's vibrant Medieval Mile, boutique shopping, cafés, bars and cultural attractions are all just a short stroll away, allowing you to enjoy everything the city has to offer on your doorstep.\n\nThe property is exceptionally well connected, with MacDonagh Railway Station and the adjacent bus station located just moments from the apartment, providing regular rail and bus services to Dublin, Waterford, Carlow and the wider South East. Local city bus routes are also readily accessible, while the Kilkenny Ring Road and M9 motorway are only a short drive away, making commuting both simple and convenient.\n\nCombining spacious accommodation with an unrivalled city centre location and outstanding transport connectivity, this excellent apartment offers a rare opportunity to enjoy contemporary living in one of Kilkenny's most convenient and sought-after settings.\n\n\nEntrance Hall Bright entrance hall with laminated timber flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 Single bedroom, ideal as a home office or study, with carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 2 Spacious double bedroom with carpet flooring, built-in wardrobe, and direct access to the balcony.\n\nEn-Suite Fully tiled and fitted with a classic white WC and WHB, electric shower, and heated towel rail.\n\nKitchen Modern tiled kitchen with integrated appliances and direct access to the balcony.\n\nLiving/Dining Area Bright open-plan living space with laminated timber flooring, seamlessly connected to the kitchen and featuring floor-to-ceiling windows that flood the room with natural light.\n\nMain Bathroom Fully tiled bathroom complete with a classic white WC and WHB, bath with overhead shower, and heated towel rail.\n\n*Disclaimer - photos have been edited using AI to enhance or brighten the image*"
      },
      {
